NoteC26=Day 239\nI stumbled across a rather fresh one today,\nfemale\nHad to resist the urge. Never know what I might catch after all.\n\nrubbed one out behind a tree instead
NoteC27=Day 256\nI met an old survivor today. Strange fellow, wouldn't shut up.\n"Stay a while and listen!"\n\n\nYeah, that got old pretty fast.
