Mission67Desc=There is a reason the safe settlement are able to remain safe, and that is constant upkeep by survivors like yourself.  The Castle Pine safe settlement is in need of clean drinking water.\n\nDeliver 5 bottles of 375ml Water to the Castle Pine safe settlement, and receive a reward for your efforts.
