101002_name=M16
101002_desc=The M16 rifle is a gas operated standard infantry assault rifle, chambered for 5.56x45mm NATO round.
101004_name=FN Five Seven
101004_desc=The FN Five Seven is a standard issue handgun that was designed to fire a 5.7 mm round. It is an effective weapon against close range targets.
101005_name=G36
101005_desc=The G36 assault rifle fires a 5.56 mm round. Its high rate of fire and medium recoil deliver a reasonably tight spread on impact of targets up to medium ranges.
101022_name=AK-74M
101022_desc=The AK-74M assault rifle is an upgrade of the AK 74 design with a slightly increased rate of fire. It fires a 5.45 x 39 mm round accurately at medium ranges.
101032_name=AKM
101032_desc=The AKM is an assault rifle that was designed as a simplified version of the AK-47 rifle. It fires a 7.62 x 39 mm round and is relatively effective at medium ranges.
101035_name=AKS-74U
101035_desc=The AKS-74U is a shortened gas operated carbine version of the AKS-74 assault rifle. It is classified as an SMG. It fires a 5.45 x 39 mm round and is very effective at medium ranges.
101040_name=M4 Semi
101040_desc=The civilian M4 semi auto rifle, chambered for 5.56x45mm NATO round.
101055_name=M4
101055_desc=The M4 is a versitile, light weight, commando style assault rifle that is gas operated and fires a 5.56 x 45 mm round effectively in both close and medium ranges.
101060_name=PKM
101060_desc=The PKM machine gun was designed to fire 7.62 mm rounds from a linked system and is reasonably accurate out to medium ranged targets.
101063_name=MP7
101063_desc=The MP7 submachine gun is a special issue weapon that fires a 4.6 mm standard cartridge from a 30 round magazine. It is effective at close range targets.
101064_name=UZI
101064_desc=The special issue UZI submachine gun is a open bolt, blow back design that fires 9 mm rounds from its magazine housed in the weapons pistol grip.
101068_name=SVD 
101068_desc=The SVD sniper rifle was designed to fire a 7.62 mm round from a 10 round clip. Combined with an Optical Sniper Scope it is extremely accurate.
101084_name=VSS VINTOREZ
101084_desc=The VSS Vintorez sniper rifle was designed to fire a 9 x 39 mm round using a gas operated, rotating bolt firing system. It is designed to be effective at medium distances.
101085_name=MAUSER SP66
101085_desc=The Mauser SP66 sniper rifle was designed to fire a .308W round from a 10 round clip. It is highly accurate at long ranges when combined with a good scope.
101087_name=AW Magnum
101087_desc=The AWM sniper rifle fires a custom .338W magnum round with devastating accuracy and effect. Each of its rounds deal a very high amount of damage.
101088_name=M107
101088_desc=The M107  sniper rifle fires a .50 caliber round that strikes with deadly effect at extreme ranges. It has a 5 round clip that allows for a high rate of fire.
101093_name=RPK-74 
101093_desc=The RPK-74 machine gun fires a 5.45 mm high velocity round that delivers a reasonably accurate rate of fire onto targets out to medium ranges.
101095_name=FN M249 
101095_desc=The FN M249 machine gun fires a 5.56 mm round from a belt fed system. It is highly effective against targets at close and medium ranges.
101098_name=SAIGA
101098_desc=The Saiga was developed as a 12 gauge shotgun with a 8 round storage tube. It inflicts a substantial amount of damage on targets at a close range.
101103_name=MP5/10
101103_desc=The MP5/10 submachine gun was designed to fire 10 mm Auto rounds from a 30 round clip effectively against close ranged targets.
101106_name=Honey Badger
101106_desc=The Honey Badger submachine gun fires a 5.45x45MM round at a medium rate of fire causing a good amount of damage on close range targets.
101107_name=FN P90 
101107_desc=The FN P90 submachine gun was designed to fire 5.7x28mm rounds from a large 50 round magazine. It is very effective on close range targets.
101108_name=EVO-3
101108_desc=The EVO-3 submachine gun was designed to effectively fire 9 mm rounds from a 30 round magazine at close ranged targets at a very high rate of fire.
101109_name=BIZON
101109_desc=The Bizon submachine gun was designed to fire a 9 mm round from a 64 round magazine delivering accurate fire on close range targets.
101111_name=B92
101111_desc=The B92 handgun was specially designed to fire a 9mm round and is reasonably effective against close range targets.
101112_name=B93R 
101112_desc=The B93R handgun was designed to fire a 9mm parabellum round from a 13 round clip. It is a relatively effective weapon against close ranged targets.
101115_name=Jericho 9mm
101115_desc=The Jericho was designed as a universal self-loading pistol which fires a 9mm Parabellum round and is highly effective at close range.
101120_name=Sig Sauer P226
101120_desc=The SIG P226 is a full-sized, service-type pistol. It has been designed to fire a 9 x 19 mm round that makes it an effective weapon against close ranged targets.
101158_name=MOSSBERG 590
101158_desc=The Mossberg 590 is a 12 gauge shotgun which has a 8 round storage tube. It is known to do an extremely high amount of damage at close range.
101169_name=MASADA
101169_desc=The Masada was designed for close combat operations and is a gas operated assault rifle that fires a chambered 5.56x45mm NATO round. It is highly effective at close ranges.
101172_name=SIG SAUER 556
101172_desc=The SIG 556 is a gas operated, rotating bolt assault rifle that fires a 5.56 x 45 mm round and was designed for special operations. It is very effective out to medium ranges.
101173_name=IMI TAR-21
101173_desc=The TAR-21 is a unique gas operated, rotating bolt, bullpup design assault rifle that fires a 5.56 x 45 mm round. It is extremely effective at close and medium range.
101180_name=Desert Eagle
101180_desc=The Desert Eagle handgun was designed to fire a .50 caliber round and deals a substantial amount of damage to targets at close ranges.
101183_name=KT DECIDER
101183_desc=The KT Decider is a bull-pup shotgun design that has an 8 round magazine.
101193_name=FN SCAR CQC
101193_desc=The SCAR CQC is an advanced assault rifle that fires standard 5.56 x 45 mm rounds effectively out to medium ranges.
101197_name=RA H23
101197_desc=The RA H23 was designed to fire a 5.56x45mm standard round. This machine gun delivers a reasonable amount of accurfate fire onto targets at medium ranges.
101200_name=AA-12
101200_desc=The AA-12 gauge automatic shotgun was designed to fire 12 gauge rounds from a 20 round storage system. It causes a reasonable amount of damage per round.
101201_name=VERESK SR-2
101201_desc=The Veresk SR-2 submachine gun was designed to fire a standard 9 mm round at a high rate of fire with reasonable accuracy at close range targets.
101210_name=FN SCAR NIGHT STALKER
101210_desc=The FN SCAR Nightstalker is an assault rifle that fires standard 5.56 x 45 mm rounds effectively out to medium ranges.
101217_name=MAUSER SRG DESERT
101217_desc=The Mauser SRG Desert sniper rifle fires a .308W round.
101224_name=STI Eagle Elite .45 ACP
101224_desc=The STI Eagle Elite handgun is an upgraded version of the STI Eagle and is designed to fire a .45 ACP round effectively at close ranges.
